        <paragraph>If $$f$$ is continuous and $$\int_{0}^{4}{f(x)\mathit{dx} = 10}$$ , find $$\int_{0}^{2}{f\left( {2x} \right)\mathit{dx}}$$ .</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$5$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
